Depends: python3, apt, network-manager, libnotify-bin, polkitd, pkexec,
         libglib2.0-bin, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: fwupd, plymouth
Description: Raye Linux system updates
 Looks for system and firmware updates in the background and downloads
 them, waiting while on a low battery, a metered connection or during a
 game. They are installed at the next start-up only after you pick
 "Update and restart" or "Update and shut down", with the progress on the
 boot screen and a snapshot taken right before, so nothing installs on
 its own. Updates can be paused for up to five weeks, and the PC never
 restarts on its own during your active hours.
